---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Announcement Centre | Confluence" description="Public updates and demonstration announcements for Confluence."><main class="feature-page"><header class="feature-head"><a class="back-link" href="/">← Confluence home</a><p class="eyebrow">ANNOUNCEMENT CENTRE</p><h1>Keep in<br/><em>the current.</em></h1><p>Public notices are shown here. Team-specific demo messages remain in the participant prototype and are not included in this public feed.</p></header><section class="announcement-tools"><label for="announcement-search">Search announcements</label><input id="announcement-search" type="search" placeholder="Search updates…"/><label for="announcement-category">Category</label><select id="announcement-category"><option value="all">All public categories</option><option value="general">General</option><option value="important">Important notice</option><option value="deadline">Deadline & roadmap</option></select><button class="secondary-action" id="mark-all-read">Mark visible as read</button></section><p class="announcement-count" id="announcement-count" aria-live="polite"></p><section class="announcement-list" id="announcement-list" aria-live="polite"></section><section class="organizer-announcement" id="announcement-admin"><p class="eyebrow">LOCAL DEMO WORKFLOW</p><h2>Organizer publishing desk</h2><p>Demo-only controls let you draft, preview, publish and archive public announcements in this browser. This is not secure authorization or shared persistence.</p><form id="announcement-form"><label>Title<input name="title" required maxlength="120"/></label><label>Category<select name="category"><option value="general">General</option><option value="important">Important notice</option><option value="deadline">Deadline & roadmap</option></select></label><label>Message<textarea name="message" required rows="3" maxlength="800"></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="secondary-action" id="preview-announcement">Preview</button><button type="submit" class="primary-action">Publish announcement</button></div></form><div id="announcement-preview" hidden></div><div class="announcement-manage"><h3>Manage local demo announcements</h3><div id="announcement-manage-list"></div></div><p class="demo-disclaimer">Seeded announcements and edits are fictional local demonstration data.</p></section></main><script src="/js/announcements.js" defer></script></SiteLayout>
